;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\山の桜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The sun is starting to sink.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are a lot of cherry trees around here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are hardly any cherry trees in the Arata settlement, so seeing a sight like this in the mountains is something new.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are cherry blossoms unusual to you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I've never really seen cherry trees in the mountains."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"We'll be entering Motoki-cho soon. Motoki-cho is a place very famous for its cherry blossoms."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Famous for cherry blossoms...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, <STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE> can sense danger at this time of year.<PG>
It's only under limited conditions, dark, cramped places, but there's no doubt the people of the settlement are always being helped by it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"All right, let's go. This road tends to get crowded toward evening."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動車エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
We get back in the car and head for Motoki-cho.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\伊勢運転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I look at <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san's</STYLE> profile as he drives.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike when we first met, his gaze is very calm and earnest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So was he pretending to be a lolicon to draw out what I really think?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm a little curious about that, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, you're awfully calm compared to the start. Why is that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"At first you were all flustered and seemed a bit unreliable, but now you have a really serious look in your eyes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I just got used to it... There's no deep meaning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Used to it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, er... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it's about a personal hobby, so don't dig into it too much..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Aha! So you ARE a lolicon, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\急ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At that moment, the car slams on the brakes, swaying left and right.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\自動車外から.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hah! Hah! What are you saying all of a sudden!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No... I just wondered if you were..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I am by no means a lolicon!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　A lolicon means a scoundrel who tries, by depraved means, to commit unwholesome acts on </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="いたいけ">innocent</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> young girls!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　What I aim for is the wholesome, healthy development of young girls!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahh... are you the fantasizing type, maybe?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Argh, no, no! I simply want to cherish them, that's all!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Cherish them...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> turns bright red and starts the car without a word.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His face is stiff again, like when we first met.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "10000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\伊勢運転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wh-wh-what!? Go ahead and despise me if you want!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, it's not that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Cherishing them is fine, but if so, it's better to narrow it down to just one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's that supposed to mean..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Girl or grown-up, a woman wants to be the only one you look at. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If you cherish girls here, there and everywhere, every one of them will turn away from you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't mind... I have no intention of laying a hand on them, and in fact I won't forgive anyone who does. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Protecting girls from people like that is also my mission."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He's saying something sort of cool, but it's somehow comical.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What would you do if a girl came on to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's just a 'what if.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No... I've never even thought about something like that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well, if she were serious, I'd have to ask her to wait until she turns 18."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, so you really are a lolicon with principles, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Not a lolicon―a devotee of pretty girls...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I mean..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A devotee of pretty girls!? There's a title like that!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh, fine, say whatever you want..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then we're partners who share each other's secrets!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'm a runaway girl of unknown background, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is a lolicon!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I said I'm not a lolicon, I'm a devotee of pretty girls!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A strange sense of closeness springs up between <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> and me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Teasing <STYLE ID="1">this man</STYLE> while we talk is quite fun.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"B-but </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you see... I'll have to send you back to your parents eventually. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Don't forget that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Understood..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't you need to contact your parents?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I don't have a cell phone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then use mine."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> hands me his smartphone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this his personal smartphone?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\五島待ち受け.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
The lock screen is a photo of a petite, cute girl with twin tails.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Who's in this photo?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wh-what does it matter! Whoever it is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I knew it! You're a lolicon, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That girl turns 20 this year!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　And anyway, I'm a devotee of pretty girls... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">no, never mind, call me whatever you want..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're serious and good-looking, so if you just acted normal, I think cute girls would come to you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wh-wh-what are you saying!"</STYLE><PG>
Leaving <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> to panic all over again, I dial our home number.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I dialed riding the momentum of this ridiculous conversation, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
I'm sure <STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE> are both angry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As it starts ringing, I get a little nervous.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hello..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hello, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!? Hey, where are you right now!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... I can't come back for a while..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What on earth happened...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I... the thought of wanting to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I just... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">can't bear it, no matter what..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I told you, Daddy can cure that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry, I still haven't sorted out my feelings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'll come home sooner or later, so... just wait a little longer for me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―wanting to kill her... it's scary..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"But still...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But! It's just... scary...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Please... just wait a little longer. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Right now I'm too scared to come home..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, I hear <STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE> heave a big sigh on the other end of the line.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Are you eating properly?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I understand how </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> feel, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is very worried too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Get in touch as often as you can, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, thank you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't let some weird old man get hold of you, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a moment I glance at <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> is driving with a serious face, eyes on the road ahead.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I'll watch out for weird people."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't do anything too reckless, okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　If you want, Daddy alone can come to you right now, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm fine. I just want to be alone for a little while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Letting <STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> get close would be bad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There'd be no point in hiding <STYLE ID="6">Auntie</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That I love </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> both."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Want me to put </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> on?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If you do, I might go crazy, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's true... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I don't know exactly when something like that would happen to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then you tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> for me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"All right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, how do I get in touch with you? Should I call this number?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I glance at <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> gives a small, silent nod.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, this number's fine. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">This man</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is a police officer."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You're with the police?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"He's a good person, really serious, and he really looks out for me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Well, if that's so... try not to cause him too much trouble. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Maybe Daddy should properly say hello to him as well―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, it's fine! I'll tell him myself, then. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Yeah... yeah... bye."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I hang up and heave a big sigh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow I've managed to get promoted to a runaway girl with parental approval.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I give back the smartphone, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> looks even more troubled.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Do </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> have some kind of bad blood with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You were saying something disturbing."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Come to think of it, I talked about killing <STYLE ID="3">Mommy</STYLE> and things like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> heard it too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"You don't have to force yourself to answer. Your parents seem to understand the situation too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I can see that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> are making the small mistake of running away from home so as not to make a big one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, whether that small mistake is really a 'mistake,' I can't say..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"After this, am I going to be questioned at the police station...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That was the plan... but you're no ordinary runaway girl, it seems. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I may not look it, but I'm a police officer. Is there anything I can do to help?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, in that case..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
I need to keep in touch with <STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE> as often as I can, and <STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE> might call me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leaving <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> would mean breaking my promise to <STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then please stay by my side the whole time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\急ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
