{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hah! Hah! What are you saying all of a sudden!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　In the first place, tempting adults like that is―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, it's because </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> might call that smartphone..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Ah, right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, no, that's not the point! Do you understand what this means!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'d be with me the whole time!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Not just during the day, but at night too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Could it be you have ulterior motives?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no, no, no! Laying a hand on an innocent young girl must never, ever happen!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　The Motoki Pretty Girl Appreciation Society aims at the wholesome development of pretty girls, and―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> keeps his eyes straight ahead, as if lecturing himself rather than talking to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, his proclivities are what they are, but he's a police officer, and serious, and a good man, and he seems to have more than enough self-control, so it'll be fine.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"―And that is why I absolutely have no ulterior motives, and will never lay a hand on anyone!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Partway through, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san's</STYLE> lecture-style monologue stopped reaching my ears, but he was probably saying the same sort of thing as before.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then it's fine, isn't it? If you have no ulterior motives, it's all right, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh...! Nghh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Taking <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san's</STYLE> excessive self-control and <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="さかな">rubbing</STYLE> it the wrong way, I gaze at <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> with a sort of sidelong glance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This man</STYLE> is easy to read, and fun.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"And another thing! Stop calling me nothing but 'you' and the like!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I have a name, and it's Kana Niimura!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh-ngh-ngh...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　What... should I... call you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Won't 'Kana' do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"By just your name!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I press the attack, urging him to drop the honorific, and send him another sidelong glance.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, I'm a middle schooler, and you're a proper grown-up, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so just my name should be fine, shouldn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh-ngh-ngh-ngh...! Th-then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Weeell?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Trying to imitate the air of a grown woman just a little, I do my best to put on an alluring voice.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ka... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ka-ka-ka..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmmm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Na..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Come ooon, you have to call me properly... or I won't like it..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Argh! I can just call you by it when I need to, can't I!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
